From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Norman Herms <dockseed@proton.me>
Date: Sun, 4 Oct 2026 05:56:24 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] dt-bindings: watchdog: sun4i-a10-wdt: Add Allwinner A733

The A733 has two watchdogs, WDT0 and WDT_CPUS, both with the register set
of the A523 watchdog. Add an A733 compatible with the A523 one as fallback.

Tested on Radxa Cubie A7S: booted on two boards; the WDT_CPUS node with
this compatible passes the schema check and probes sunxi-wdt through the
fallback.

Assisted-by: LLM
---
 .../devicetree/bindings/watchdog/allwinner,sun4i-a10-wdt.yaml  | 3 +++
 1 file changed, 3 insertions(+)

diff --git a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/watchdog/allwinner,sun4i-a10-wdt.yaml b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/watchdog/allwinner,sun4i-a10-wdt.yaml
index b35ac03d5172..0744e005e974 100644
--- a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/watchdog/allwinner,sun4i-a10-wdt.yaml
+++ b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/watchdog/allwinner,sun4i-a10-wdt.yaml
@@ -33,6 +33,9 @@ properties:
           - const: allwinner,sun20i-d1-wdt-reset
           - const: allwinner,sun20i-d1-wdt
       - const: allwinner,sun55i-a523-wdt
+      - items:
+          - const: allwinner,sun60i-a733-wdt
+          - const: allwinner,sun55i-a523-wdt
 
   reg:
     maxItems: 1
